    [num_batches,
     input_spatial_shape[0],
     ...,
     input_spatial_shape[N-1],
     num_input_channels],

  a rank (N+2) `filters` Tensor of shape

    [spatial_filter_shape[0],
     ...,
     spatial_filter_shape[N-1],
     num_input_channels,
     num_output_channels],

